creatures:
- name: Druid
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 13  
      **Hit Points** 44 (rollable(dice=8d8 + 8,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Medicine rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Medicine Check), Nature rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Nature Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Gear** studded leather armor  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 15  
      **Languages** Common, Druidic, Sylvan  
      **Challenge** 2 (450 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The druid makes two attacks, using Vine Staff or Verdant Wisp in any combination.

      ***Vine Staff.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Vine Staff]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Vine Staff]) Bludgeoning damage plus rollable(dice=1d4,dicelabel=Damage [Vine Staff]) Poison damage.

      ***Verdant Wisp.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Verdant Wisp]), range 90 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d6,dicelabel=Damage [Verdant Wisp]) Radiant damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The druid casts one of the following spells, using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13):

      At will: [Druidcraft](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619158-druidcraft), [Speak with Animals](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619059-speak-with-animals)  
      2/day each: [Entangle](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619186-entangle), [Thunderwave](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619184-thunderwave)  
      1/day each: [Animal Messenger](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618850-animal-messenger), [Longstrider](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619004-longstrider), [Moonbeam](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619134-moonbeam)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
